### Get user
GET http://localhost:5023/users/4

### Get missing user [404 Not Found]
GET http://localhost:5023/users/9999

### All users
GET http://localhost:5023/users

### Filter users
GET http://localhost:5023/users?username=te

### Filter users
GET http://localhost:5023/users?username=tea

